---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<div class="friend-apply" data-friend-apply>
	<button type="button" class="friend-apply__trigger signal-marker" data-open-friend-apply aria-haspopup="dialog">
		<Icon name="material-symbols:link-rounded" aria-hidden="true" />
		<span>申请友链</span>
		<Icon name="material-symbols:arrow-outward-rounded" aria-hidden="true" />
	</button>

	<dialog class="friend-apply__dialog" data-friend-apply-dialog aria-labelledby="friend-apply-title">
		<form class="friend-apply__form" data-friend-apply-form>
			<div class="friend-apply__heading">
				<div>
					<span class="signal-kicker">COMMUNITY / CONNECTION REQUEST</span>
					<h2 id="friend-apply-title">申请友链</h2>
				</div>
				<button type="button" class="friend-apply__close" data-close-friend-apply aria-label="关闭申请友链弹窗">×</button>
			</div>
			<p class="friend-apply__intro">欢迎交换友链。请先确认本站信息与申请约定，再留下你的站点资料。</p>

			<div class="friend-apply__guide">
				<section class="friend-apply__site" aria-labelledby="friend-site-title">
					<div class="friend-apply__site-profile">
						<img src="/assets/home/home.png" alt="Tonks' blog 头像" width="72" height="72" draggable="false" />
						<div>
							<span>THIS SITE / 本站信息</span>
							<h3 id="friend-site-title">Tonks' blog</h3>
							<p>我用全部记忆写下，你此刻的盛大</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<dl class="friend-apply__site-data">
						<div>
							<dt>站点名称</dt><dd>Tonks' blog</dd>
							<button type="button" data-copy-value="Tonks' blog" aria-label="复制站点名称"><Icon name="material-symbols:content-copy-outline-rounded" /></button>
						</div>
						<div>
							<dt>站点描述</dt><dd>我用全部记忆写下，你此刻的盛大</dd>
							<button type="button" data-copy-value="我用全部记忆写下，你此刻的盛大" aria-label="复制站点描述"><Icon name="material-symbols:content-copy-outline-rounded" /></button>
						</div>
						<div>
							<dt>站点链接</dt><dd>https://blog.tonks.top</dd>
							<button type="button" data-copy-value="https://blog.tonks.top" aria-label="复制站点链接"><Icon name="material-symbols:content-copy-outline-rounded" /></button>
						</div>
						<div>
							<dt>头像链接</dt><dd>https://blog.tonks.top/assets/home/home.png</dd>
							<button type="button" data-copy-value="https://blog.tonks.top/assets/home/home.png" aria-label="复制头像链接"><Icon name="material-symbols:content-copy-outline-rounded" /></button>
						</div>
					</dl>
					<button type="button" class="friend-apply__copy-all" data-copy-value={`站点名称：Tonks' blog\n站点描述：我用全部记忆写下，你此刻的盛大\n站点链接：https://blog.tonks.top\n头像链接：https://blog.tonks.top/assets/home/home.png`}>
						<Icon name="material-symbols:content-copy-outline-rounded" /> 复制全部本站信息
					</button>
				</section>

				<section class="friend-apply__steps" aria-labelledby="friend-steps-title">
					<div class="friend-apply__section-title">
						<Icon name="material-symbols:assignment-add-outline-rounded" />
						<h3 id="friend-steps-title">申请步骤</h3>
					</div>
					<ol>
						<li><span>1</span><div><strong>添加本站友链</strong><p>先把左侧资料添加到你的友链页，确保链接与头像可以正常访问。</p></div></li>
						<li><span>2</span><div><strong>填写申请资料</strong><p>在弹窗底部展开申请表，留下站点名称、链接、头像和一句介绍。</p></div></li>
						<li><span>3</span><div><strong>等待审核</strong><p>信息确认无误后会被贴到友链墙；需要补充时会通过邮箱或网站联系。</p></div></li>
					</ol>
				</section>
			</div>

			<aside class="friend-apply__notice" aria-labelledby="friend-notice-title">
				<div class="friend-apply__section-title">
					<Icon name="material-symbols:info-outline-rounded" />
					<h3 id="friend-notice-title">申请注意事项</h3>
				</div>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>互换原则：</strong>请先添加本站友链，确认后会尽快回访并添加你的站点。</li>
					<li><strong>访问要求：</strong>支持 HTTPS，能够正常访问，近期仍有维护或内容更新。</li>
					<li><strong>内容要求：</strong>以原创或长期维护内容为主，不收录广告、采集及违法违规站点。</li>
					<li><strong>信息稳定：</strong>请使用稳定的站点与头像直链；信息变更可在评论区告知。</li>
				</ul>
			</aside>

			<details class="friend-apply__application" data-friend-apply-details>
				<summary>
					<span><strong>填写申请资料</strong><small>资料会进入待审核列表，不会直接出现在友链墙</small></span>
					<Icon name="material-symbols:keyboard-arrow-down-rounded" />
				</summary>
				<div class="friend-apply__application-body">
					<div class="friend-apply__grid">
						<label><span>站点名称 <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></span><input name="name" required maxlength="40" placeholder="你的站点名称" /></label>
						<label><span>站点链接 <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></span><input name="website" type="url" required maxlength="300" placeholder="https://example.com" /></label>
						<label><span>头像链接</span><input name="avatar" type="url" maxlength="300" placeholder="https://…/avatar.png（可选）" /></label>
						<label><span>联系邮箱</span><input name="email" type="email" maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" placeholder="仅用于申请沟通（可选）" /></label>
						<label class="friend-apply__description"><span>站点描述 <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></span><textarea name="description" required maxlength="240" rows="3" placeholder="一句话介绍你的站点"></textarea></label>
					</div>
					<div class="friend-apply__footer">
						<span data-friend-apply-status aria-live="polite"></span>
						<button type="submit" class="signal-marker">提交申请 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
					</div>
					<div class="friend-apply__tracking" data-friend-apply-tracking hidden>
						<div>
							<strong>请保存本次查询码</strong>
							<small>浏览器会自动保存；清理站点数据后可凭此码找回申请。请勿公开分享。</small>
						</div>
						<code data-friend-apply-token></code>
						<button type="button" data-copy-value="" data-copy-tracking aria-label="复制申请查询码"><Icon name="material-symbols:content-copy-outline-rounded" /></button>
					</div>
				</div>
			</details>

			<details class="friend-apply__application friend-apply__history" data-friend-apply-history>
				<summary>
					<span><strong>我的申请</strong><small>查看这台设备提交过的友链申请与审核结果</small></span>
					<Icon name="material-symbols:keyboard-arrow-down-rounded" />
				</summary>
				<div class="friend-apply__history-body">
					<div class="friend-apply__history-heading">
						<p>审核通过后仍需由站长更新静态友链数据，不代表会立刻出现在友链墙。</p>
						<button type="button" data-refresh-friend-applications><Icon name="material-symbols:refresh-rounded" /> 刷新状态</button>
					</div>
					<div class="friend-apply__history-list" data-friend-apply-history-list aria-live="polite"></div>
				</div>
			</details>
		</form>
	</dialog>
</div>

<style>
	.friend-apply { display: inline-flex; }
	.friend-apply { flex-shrink: 0; }
	.friend-apply__trigger { white-space: nowrap; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; padding: 0.55rem 0.75rem; color: var(--signal-ink); border: 1px solid var(--signal-line); border-radius: 0.25rem; background: var(--signal); cursor: pointer; font: 800 0.68rem/1 "JetBrains Mono Variable", monospace; letter-spacing: 0.03em; transition: transform var(--motion-signal-fast) var(--ease-signal), box-shadow var(--motion-signal-fast) ease; }
	.friend-apply__trigger:hover,
	.friend-apply__trigger:focus-visible { box-shadow: 0.18rem 0.2rem 0 color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 18%, transparent); transform: translate(-0.06rem, -0.06rem); }
	.friend-apply__trigger:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--primary); outline-offset: 2px; }
	.friend-apply__trigger :global(svg) { width: 0.95rem; height: 0.95rem; }
	.friend-apply__trigger :global(svg:last-child) { width: 0.7rem; height: 0.7rem; margin-left: 0.1rem; }
	.friend-apply__dialog { width: min(58rem, calc(100vw - 2rem)); max-height: calc(100dvh - 2rem); padding: 0; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); border: 1px solid var(--signal-line); border-radius: 0.55rem; opacity: 0; background: var(--card-bg); box-shadow: 0.18rem 0.22rem 0 color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 7%, transparent); filter: blur(2px); transform: translateY(-0.7rem) scale(0.975) rotate(-0.18deg); transform-origin: 50% 12%; transition: opacity 180ms ease, filter 180ms ease, transform 260ms var(--ease-signal), box-shadow 260ms var(--ease-signal); }
	.friend-apply__dialog.is-visible { opacity: 1; box-shadow: 0.55rem 0.6rem 0 color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 13%, transparent); filter: none; transform: translateY(0) scale(1) rotate(0); }
	.friend-apply__dialog.is-closing { pointer-events: none; }
	:global(html.dark) .friend-apply__dialog { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); }
	.friend-apply__dialog::backdrop { opacity: 0; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--card-bg) 70%, transparent); backdrop-filter: blur(0); transition: opacity 200ms ease, backdrop-filter 240ms ease; }
	.friend-apply__dialog.is-visible::backdrop { opacity: 1; backdrop-filter: blur(3px); }
	.friend-apply__form { display: grid; gap: 1rem; padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.5rem); background: linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--signal-soft) 32%, transparent), transparent 52%); }
	.friend-apply__heading { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }
	.friend-apply__heading h2 { margin: 0.4rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 4vw, 2rem); }
	.friend-apply__close { display: grid; width: 1.8rem; height: 1.8rem; place-items: center; padding: 0; color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 54%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 14%, transparent); border-radius: 50%; background: none; cursor: pointer; font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1; }
	.friend-apply__intro { margin: 0; color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 58%, transparent); font-size: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.6; }
	.friend-apply__guide { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.05fr); gap: 0.9rem; }
	.friend-apply__site,
	.friend-apply__steps,
	.friend-apply__notice,
	.friend-apply__application { border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--signal-line) 50%, currentColor 10%); border-radius: 0.4rem; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--industrial-surface) 90%, transparent); }
	.friend-apply__site,
	.friend-apply__steps,
	.friend-apply__notice { padding: 1rem; }
	.friend-apply__site-profile { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); align-items: center; gap: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
	.friend-apply__site-profile img { width: 4.25rem; height: 4.25rem; object-fit: cover; border: 1px solid var(--signal-line); border-radius: 0.55rem 0.85rem 0.6rem 0.75rem; box-shadow: 0.16rem 0.18rem 0 color-mix(in srgb, var(--signal-line) 25%, transparent); user-select: none; -webkit-user-drag: none; }
	.friend-apply__site-profile span { color: var(--signal-line); font: 800 0.5rem/1 "JetBrains Mono Variable", monospace; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
	.friend-apply__site-profile h3 { margin: 0.25rem 0; font-size: 1.1rem; }
	.friend-apply__site-profile p { margin: 0; color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 57%, transparent); font-size: 0.68rem; line-height: 1.45; }
	.friend-apply__site-data { display: grid; gap: 0.45rem; margin: 0; }
	.friend-apply__site-data > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(4rem, auto) minmax(0, 1fr) auto; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem; min-height: 2.55rem; padding: 0.45rem 0.55rem; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 9%, transparent); border-radius: 0.28rem; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--card-bg) 86%, transparent); }
	.friend-apply__site-data dt { color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 45%, transparent); font-size: 0.58rem; }
	.friend-apply__site-data dd { min-width: 0; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
	.friend-apply__site-data button,
	.friend-apply__copy-all { display: inline-grid; place-items: center; color: var(--signal-ink); border: 1px solid var(--signal-line); border-radius: 0.25rem; background: var(--signal); cursor: pointer; }
	.friend-apply__site-data button { width: 1.8rem; height: 1.8rem; padding: 0; }
	.friend-apply__site-data button :global(svg),
	.friend-apply__copy-all :global(svg) { width: 0.9rem; height: 0.9rem; }
	.friend-apply__site-data button.is-copied,
	.friend-apply__copy-all.is-copied { border-color: var(--primary); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--signal) 70%, var(--primary)); }
	.friend-apply__copy-all { grid-auto-flow: column; gap: 0.4rem; margin-top: 0.65rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem; font-size: 0.64rem; font-weight: 800; }
	.friend-apply__section-title { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem; }
	.friend-apply__section-title :global(svg) { width: 1.1rem; height: 1.1rem; color: var(--signal-line); }
	.friend-apply__section-title h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; }
	.friend-apply__steps ol { display: grid; gap: 0; margin: 0.8rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
	.friend-apply__steps li { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 0.7rem; padding-bottom: 0.85rem; }
	.friend-apply__steps li:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }
	.friend-apply__steps li:not(:last-child)::before { position: absolute; top: 1.7rem; bottom: 0.15rem; left: 0.78rem; border-left: 1px solid var(--signal-line); content: ""; opacity: 0.55; }
	.friend-apply__steps li > span { display: grid; width: 1.6rem; height: 1.6rem; place-items: center; color: var(--signal-ink); border-radius: 50%; background: var(--signal); font: 800 0.65rem/1 "JetBrains Mono Variable", monospace; }
	.friend-apply__steps strong { font-size: 0.76rem; }
	.friend-apply__steps p { margin: 0.25rem 0 0; color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 55%, transparent); font-size: 0.66rem; line-height: 1.55; }
	.friend-apply__notice ul { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 0.5rem 1rem; margin: 0.75rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
	.friend-apply__notice li { position: relative; padding-left: 0.8rem; color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 60%, transparent); font-size: 0.66rem; line-height: 1.55; }
	.friend-apply__notice li::before { position: absolute; top: 0.58em; left: 0; width: 0.3rem; height: 0.3rem; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--signal-line); content: ""; }
	.friend-apply__notice strong { color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 82%, transparent); }
	.friend-apply__application { overflow: hidden; }
	.friend-apply__application summary { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: 0.8rem 1rem; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--signal-soft) 48%, var(--industrial-surface)); }
	.friend-apply__application summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
	.friend-apply__application summary > span { display: grid; gap: 0.2rem; }
	.friend-apply__application summary strong { font-size: 0.78rem; }
	.friend-apply__application summary small { color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 50%, transparent); font-size: 0.6rem; }
	.friend-apply__application summary :global(svg) { width: 1.2rem; height: 1.2rem; color: var(--signal-line); transition: transform var(--motion-signal-fast) var(--ease-signal); }
	.friend-apply__application[open] summary :global(svg) { transform: rotate(180deg); }
	.friend-apply__application-body { display: grid; gap: 0.8rem; padding: 1rem; border-top: 1px dashed var(--signal-line); }
	.friend-apply__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 0.8rem; }
	.friend-apply__grid label { display: grid; gap: 0.4rem; color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 68%, transparent); font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; }
	.friend-apply__grid label span b { color: var(--signal-line); }
	.friend-apply__grid input,
	.friend-apply__grid textarea { width: 100%; min-width: 0; padding: 0.68rem 0.72rem; color: inherit; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 16%, transparent); border-radius: 0.25rem; outline: none; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--industrial-surface) 90%, transparent); font: inherit; font-size: 0.78rem; resize: vertical; }
	.friend-apply__grid input:focus,
	.friend-apply__grid textarea:focus { border-color: var(--signal-line); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 15%, transparent); }
	.friend-apply__description { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
	.friend-apply__footer { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.8rem; }
	.friend-apply__footer > span { min-height: 1.1rem; color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 52%, transparent); font-size: 0.68rem; }
	.friend-apply__footer > span[data-state="error"] { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--signal-line) 75%, #c33); }
	.friend-apply__footer button { padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; color: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--signal-line); border-radius: 0.2rem; background: var(--signal-line); cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 800; }
	.friend-apply__footer button:disabled { cursor: wait; opacity: 0.58; }
	.friend-apply__tracking { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(7rem, auto) auto; align-items: center; gap: 0.65rem; padding: 0.7rem; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--signal-line) 45%, transparent); border-radius: 0.3rem; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--signal-soft) 38%, var(--industrial-surface)); }
	.friend-apply__tracking[hidden] { display: none; }
	.friend-apply__tracking strong,
	.friend-apply__tracking small { display: block; }
	.friend-apply__tracking strong { font-size: 0.72rem; }
	.friend-apply__tracking small { margin-top: 0.15rem; color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 52%, transparent); font-size: 0.58rem; line-height: 1.45; }
	.friend-apply__tracking code { min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; padding: 0.45rem 0.55rem; border-radius: 0.22rem; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--card-bg) 82%, transparent); font-size: 0.58rem; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
	.friend-apply__tracking button,
	.friend-apply__history-heading button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.35rem; color: var(--signal-ink); border: 1px solid var(--signal-line); border-radius: 0.22rem; background: var(--signal); cursor: pointer; }
	.friend-apply__tracking button { width: 2rem; height: 2rem; padding: 0; }
	.friend-apply__tracking button :global(svg),
	.friend-apply__history-heading button :global(svg) { width: 0.9rem; height: 0.9rem; }
	.friend-apply__history-body { display: grid; gap: 0.75rem; padding: 0.9rem 1rem 1rem; border-top: 1px dashed var(--signal-line); }
	.friend-apply__history-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.8rem; }
	.friend-apply__history-heading p { margin: 0; color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 52%, transparent); font-size: 0.62rem; line-height: 1.5; }
	.friend-apply__history-heading button { flex: 0 0 auto; padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem; font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 800; }
	.friend-apply__history-list { display: grid; gap: 0.55rem; }
	.friend-apply__history-empty { margin: 0; padding: 1.2rem; color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 52%, transparent); border: 1px dashed color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 16%, transparent); border-radius: 0.3rem; text-align: center; font-size: 0.68rem; }
	.friend-apply__history-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 0.45rem 0.8rem; padding: 0.75rem; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 11%, transparent); border-radius: 0.3rem; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--card-bg) 85%, transparent); }
	.friend-apply__history-card h4 { margin: 0; font-size: 0.76rem; }
	.friend-apply__history-card h4 a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
	.friend-apply__history-card h4 a:hover { color: var(--signal-line); }
	.friend-apply__history-card p { grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: 0; color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 57%, transparent); font-size: 0.64rem; line-height: 1.55; }
	.friend-apply__history-card time { color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 42%, transparent); font-size: 0.56rem; }
	.friend-apply__history-status { align-self: start; padding: 0.22rem 0.48rem; border-radius: 999px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--signal-soft) 55%, transparent); color: var(--signal-line); font: 800 0.55rem/1 "JetBrains Mono Variable", monospace; }
	.friend-apply__history-status[data-status="approved"] { color: color-mix(in srgb, #16824a 80%, currentColor); background: color-mix(in srgb, #44c77d 14%, transparent); }
	.friend-apply__history-status[data-status="rejected"] { color: color-mix(in srgb, #c33 78%, currentColor); background: color-mix(in srgb, #c33 10%, transparent); }
	@media (max-width: 760px) {
		.friend-apply__guide,
		.friend-apply__notice ul { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
	}
	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.friend-apply__dialog { width: calc(100vw - 1rem); max-height: calc(100dvh - 1rem); }
		.friend-apply__form { padding: 0.85rem; }
		.friend-apply__site,
		.friend-apply__steps,
		.friend-apply__notice { padding: 0.8rem; }
		.friend-apply__site-data > div { grid-template-columns: 3.7rem minmax(0, 1fr) auto; }
		.friend-apply__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.friend-apply__description { grid-column: auto; }
		.friend-apply__footer { align-items: stretch; flex-direction: column; }
		.friend-apply__footer button { width: 100%; }
		.friend-apply__tracking { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; }
